# ARC-00: build context is the repo root. Only the v1 app (legacy/) and the runtime prompt
# (ai-instruction/ai-gen/) are needed by legacy/Dockerfile — everything else is excluded.
*
!legacy/
!ai-instruction/ai-gen/

# Inside legacy/: reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image
legacy/node_modules
legacy/.next
legacy/dist
legacy/out

# Secrets — must NEVER be baked into the image
legacy/**/.env
legacy/**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
!legacy/.env.example

# Dev/CI files not needed in the image
legacy/tests
legacy/scripts
legacy/migrations
legacy/**/*.test.ts

# Editor / OS noise
legacy/.vscode
legacy/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
